# The box image is built from THIS module as its context (plan 49 step 3), so
# the exclusions the monorepo's .dockerignore used to provide have to exist here
# too — they stopped applying the moment the context stopped being the repo root.
.git
# The bundled git archives are fetched and checksum-verified inside the build
# stage. A local copy in the context is reused only when it matches the pinned
# sha256, so shipping ~50MB of them into every build is pure cost.
git/bundled
# Not part of the artifact.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
